<title>SINGAPORE: Exabyte appoints Malaysia distributor.</title>
<headline>Exabyte appoints Malaysia distributor.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Data storage device manufacturer Exabyte Corp said on Friday it had appointed CSA Distribution to expand its market presence in Malaysia.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that CSA Distribution, a subsidiary of CSA Holdings Ltd, would carry Exabyte's entire family of tape storage products, including its new range of 8-mm tape drives and tape libraries.</p>
<p>CSA will be Exabyte's third distributor in Malaysia.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom 65-8703080</p>
